From c239f88567d9b3cc01fef26048329ccd487b1ec5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:54:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 05/39] bitproxy: import WireGuard servers in-app

New BitProxy screen (Settings > BitProxy) to import .conf files through
the system file picker, select the active server and delete servers.
Configs are stored in private app storage; choices in SharedPreferences
keyed by package + user id. Upstream hooks: one route registration in
Navigation.kt and one entry card in SettingsScreen.kt.
